  /* f,f+2 · hell sweep · dummy rush (2026-09-13) */
  'mode.rush30.name':'Dummy Rush 30s', 'mode.rush30.desc':'High, mid and low dummies appear at random for 30 seconds. High = EWGF, mid = f,f+2, low = hell sweep (f,N,d,df+4): 10 points each (a non-just WGF scores 5), plus 1–3 points per crouch dash by chain length.',
