  'a.tongbal.title':'f,f+2', 'a.tongbal.sub':'f,f+2 · mid', 'a.tongbal.coach':'f,f+2: press 2 while holding the second f (or right after releasing it). Destroys the mid dummy.',
  'a.hellsweep.title':'Hell Sweep', 'a.hellsweep.sub':'f,N,d,df+4 · low', 'a.hellsweep.coach':'Hell sweep is <strong>f, N, d, d/f+4</strong>. No just frame — press 4 comfortably after d/f. Destroys the low dummy.',
  'a.hellsweepEarly.title':'4 before d/f', 'a.hellsweepEarly.sub':'4 was pressed before the d/f', 'a.hellsweepEarly.coach':'Hell sweep needs the 4 after d/f goes in. Unlike EWGF there is no rush.',
