  'tj.j.ju':'Jet Upper', 'tj.j.juFast':'Fastest Jet Upper!', 'tj.j.slow':'Jet Upper outside the measured range', 'tj.j.b2':'No neutral · b+2', 'tj.j.rp':'RP before b · 2',
  'tj.c.intro':()=>`The frame you press <strong>1+3+4</strong> (taunt) is 1f. The knee lands on ${TJ.KNEE_F}f; cancel with <strong>6 on ${TJ_SIX}f · N on ${TJ_SIX+1}f · 4+RP on ${TJ_GO}f</strong> and the Jet Upper lands on ${TJ_LAST}f for a combo.`,
  'tj.c.split':n=>'1, 3 and 4 came over '+n+' frames, so no taunt came out. Press all three on one frame, or set the 1+3+4 key in the settings (the game\'s LP+LK+RK shortcut).',
  'tj.c.juFast':total=>'Fastest Jet Upper: f 1f · n 1f · b and RP on one frame — it lands '+total+'f after the f. Keep exactly this rhythm after the taunt.',
  'tj.c.ju':(f,n,early)=>'Jet Upper. After the taunt only the fastest one (f 1f · n 1f · b+2 on one frame) combos —'+[f>0?' f −'+f+'f':'', n>0?' n −'+n+'f':'', early>0?' b and RP on one frame':''].join('')+'.',
  'tj.c.slow':()=>`Outside what was measured (f 1~${TJ.JU_F_MAX}f · n 1~${TJ.JU_N_MAX}f · b up to ${TJ.JU_B_EARLY}f early), so whether a Jet Upper comes out is not confirmed. Input it faster.`,
  'tj.c.b2':'No neutral, so b+2 (17f) comes out instead of the Jet Upper. Release f for one frame of neutral, then b+2.',
  'tj.c.rp':'RP came before b, so 2 (10f) comes out instead of the Jet Upper. Press b and RP on the same frame (b 1~3f early still works, just that much later).',
  'tj.c.tju':n=>`Taunt Jet Upper! f on ${TJ_SIX}f · n on ${TJ_SIX+1}f · b+2 on ${TJ_GO}f — the Jet Upper landed on ${TJ_LAST}f.`+(n>1?' '+n+' in a row!':''),
  'tj.c.none':(cancel,loss)=>`The taunt played out (−${loss} even after the knee). Cancel it with f on the frame after the knee (${TJ_SIX}f); it can be cancelled up to ${cancel}f.`,
  'tj.c.ignored':(f,cancel,end)=>`The ${f}f input was ignored: the taunt cancels only up to ${cancel}f, later inputs are dropped until ${end}f. Counting the rhythm from the taunt press works better.`,
  'tj.c.early':(f,knee,next)=>`The ${f}f input cancelled the taunt before the knee (${knee}f). The first input (f) goes on the frame after the knee lands: ${next}f.`,
  'tj.c.cancelSix':f=>`Cancelled on ${f}f — the Jet Upper timing. Now chain f → n → b+2 one frame each.`,
  'tj.c.cancelLate':(f,target)=>`Cancelled on ${f}f — the knee landed, but ${f-target}f late. The Jet Upper combos only from a ${target}f cancel (f).`,
  'tj.c.combo':(m,spare)=>`Combo: ${m} (${spare}f to spare). The Jet Upper has 0f to spare, so it needs f on ${TJ_SIX}f.`,
  'tj.c.sixLate':(a,target)=>`f went in on ${a}f. It has to be ${target}f, the frame after the knee, for the Jet Upper to land by ${TJ_LAST}f.`,
  'tj.c.fLong':f=>`f was held ${f}f. After the taunt it is f 1f · n 1f — release f right away.`,
  'tj.c.nLong':n=>`Neutral lasted ${n}f. Neutral is 1f, b+2 on the next frame.`,
  'tj.c.bEarly':n=>`b came ${n}f before RP, so the Jet Upper came out that much later. Press b and RP on the same frame.`,
  'tj.c.late':n=>`The Jet Upper landed ${n}f late and was guarded. Hit f ${TJ_SIX}f · n ${TJ_SIX+1}f · b+2 ${TJ_GO}f.`,
  'tj.c.noN':'No neutral, so b+2 (17f) came out instead of the Jet Upper — a 17f move never combos after the taunt. f → n → b+2.',
  'tj.c.rpFirst':'RP came before b, so 2 came out instead of the Jet Upper. Press b and RP on the same frame.',
